{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 7080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4040, "text": "You want to sign these for me, Judge?\nSure, you want to see a card trick rise?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 8520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 7120, "text": "Here, you cut the deck."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 19880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13620, "text": "You want to sign those for me now,\nJudge?"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 23540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22540, "text": "Whatever you say."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 29220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 27060, "text": "Did you say something?"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 30640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 29640, "text": "Like what?"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 37170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35129, "text": "Like... You're drooling all over the\nwarrant."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 38670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37670, "text": "Oh, sorry."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 46090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 45090, "text": "It's Mac."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 48150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46750, "text": "I'll go get some bibs."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 53650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52650, "text": "Hey,"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 55770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54770, "text": "Mac, are you okay?"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 59930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56090, "text": "Oh, yes, sir. It's a personal problem.\nNot the court's concern. I'll be fine."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 61580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60380, "text": "You sure? Oh, yes, I'm sure."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 62800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61800, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 69220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 65600, "text": "Next case, sir. Huebner versus Huebner."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 72860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 69780, "text": "That's what I thought you said. You've\ndone some pretty little things, Darlene,"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 76780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72860, "text": "but this is the law. Hey, I don't need\nto be lectured about low from someone"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 79360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76780, "text": "who's sleeping with Schleppo the Wonder\nRunt here."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 84630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 81390, "text": "Mr. Prosecutor, what's the story here?\nYour Honor, we have a tragic situation"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 89010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84630, "text": "here involving increasing alienation\nbetween the two sisters who stand before"}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 92710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 89010, "text": "you. I'm sure the court deplores as much\nas the state does the circumstances"}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 94970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92710, "text": "which would cause... Make it brief, Dan."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 97450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95250, "text": "Hatchetface snatched her father from the\nsluts."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 104090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101010, "text": "Your Honor, both daughters are claiming\nright to custody of their father, Mr."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 107330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 104250, "text": "Huebner. He was temporarily staying in\nthe home of the plaintiff, Miss Lorna"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 109410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 107330, "text": "Huebner. Daddy always loved me back."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 110790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 109790, "text": "That's a lie!"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 115790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 111210, "text": "He almost disowned her when she took up\nwith the slob. But I didn't marry the"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 121210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 115790, "text": "slob, did I? Even worse, you moved in\nwith him. And the slob is..."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 125450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 121210, "text": "Neil Gorman, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 128550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 126410, "text": "Slob's just a nickname my parents gave\nme."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 133390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 130910, "text": "Well, I guess butch was kind of out of\nthe question."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 140260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 135850, "text": "Your Honor, my father's dying words\nwere, no matter what... Don't make me go"}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 141260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 140260, "text": "with Darlene."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 143540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 141420, "text": "Why, you liar! Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa,\nwhoa."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 146760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 144860, "text": "Dying words? Is Dad dead?"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 148280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 147140, "text": "Has a kipper on a cracker."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 152080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 150780, "text": "I'm sorry to say."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 155520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152820, "text": "Well, it's just the way you were talking\nabout him. I kind of got the impression"}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 156820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 155520, "text": "that he was, you know, here."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 159000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 158000, "text": "He is, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 165040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 162660, "text": "This is Mr."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 166240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 165240, "text": "Huebner."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 172840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 171240, "text": "Gee, he's a lot shorter than I pictured."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 219820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 215920, "text": "Okay, let me get this straight. This\ncontains the remains of your departed"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 223240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 219820, "text": "father? Uh -huh. After he died, he was\ncremated."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 225140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 223620, "text": "It's always better after."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 230580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227140, "text": "I specifically requested that my father\nbe given to me."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 235060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 230920, "text": "Well, I'm having a little trouble seeing\nwhy it's so important where he is now."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 239140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 235700, "text": "Sir, you're talking about my father, the\nman I love."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 242600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 240140, "text": "Nothing says loving like someone in the\noven."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 252820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248400, "text": "And because the urn is laced with 14\n-carat gold. That's a lie. The urn just"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 254100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 252820, "text": "happens to go with daddy."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 257839, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254460, "text": "Yeah, well, it just happens to go with\nmy drapes. Your drapes. Ladies, ladies,"}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 259060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258060, "text": "ladies, ladies."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 268100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262520, "text": "Now, grief and decor aside, you got to\nunderstand that I can only listen to one"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 269240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268100, "text": "voice at a time."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 278170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273830, "text": "belongs to him. Believe me, believe me,\nthose checks will be in the mail to you"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 279149, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 278170, "text": "by morning."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 280890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279150, "text": "In fact, you know what I told my wife?"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 285550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281370, "text": "Yeah, I said, cancel all plans,\nsweetheart. Tonight we are licking"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 288210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 287150, "text": "Mac, do you mind?"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 289570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288510, "text": "Oh, no, sir. Just go right ahead."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 294330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 290930, "text": "Your Honor, I move for dismissal. Well,\nI don't see any grounds for a"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 296290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294330, "text": "trespassing charge, so I'll grant the\nmotion."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 299470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296630, "text": "Uh, what about the disposition of, uh...\nThe soot?"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 305310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301950, "text": "Ladies, I don't suppose you'd consider\nsplitting dad 50 -50, would you?"}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 307830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306830, "text": "Didn't think so."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 310790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 308270, "text": "Guess that idea was sort of... Half\n-baked."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 315530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313670, "text": "I never used to be like this, huh?"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 320090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316650, "text": "Well, until I can make a determination\nabout permanent custody, we'll just"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 323250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320090, "text": "consider old Herb here a ward of the\ncourt, which is adjourned."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 325810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324030, "text": "Dan, give that to Bull, would you? Sure."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 331990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330990, "text": "You done?"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 334770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 332130, "text": "Yeah. I guess they removed the jewelry\nbefore, huh?"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 340150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 338470, "text": "Matt, would you get that?"}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 345790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 344790, "text": "Thanks."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 349790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347170, "text": "Matt, is there anything I can do to\nhelp?"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 351090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 350090, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 353810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 352650, "text": "Give me all your money."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 357650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 355910, "text": "Matt, give me my hands. If I can."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 359010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358010, "text": "Hey, hey, now."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 361290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 359690, "text": "Does somebody mind telling me what's\ngoing on here?"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 364870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361530, "text": "I think Mac is mugging me, sir. Mac,\nMac, Mac, Mac."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 367450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365770, "text": "Now, what is this about the money?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 371710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368650, "text": "Sir, you know the little restaurant Quan\nLee and I bought?"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 373610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 372050, "text": "Sure. Toilet City."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 378030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 374190, "text": "Well, it's not the Russian tea room.\nSir, it's not the subway men's room."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 382310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379130, "text": "It just never took off. I don't know."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 386290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383830, "text": "Maybe if we had... A customer?"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 387650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 386650, "text": "That would have helped."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 391760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389000, "text": "But the point is, the bank loan's due\nand I'm broke."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 396280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392120, "text": "So you might lose the restaurant? Yeah,\nand my car, and my furniture, even the"}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 397280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396280, "text": "clothes on my back."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 398540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 397540, "text": "Oh, Max."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 401920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 399760, "text": "I love this sweater, Harry."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 405840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403400, "text": "Oh, Max, how did you get yourself into\nthis mess?"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 407920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406920, "text": "Hi, everybody."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 410820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408880, "text": "I married the national debt."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 418650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417130, "text": "What did we say about sales?"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 420550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 419270, "text": "Oh, don't worry, Mac."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 422270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420810, "text": "These were not on sale."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 426190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 425190, "text": "How much?"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 429890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 427330, "text": "Hello, my great big hunk of man."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 432490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430310, "text": "How much? You look tired."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 434130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 432710, "text": "You want me to rub your neck?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 436610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 434670, "text": "How much, Juan Lee?"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 441310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440310, "text": "$488."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 447400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 445640, "text": "I already got matching lazy boys thanks\nto her."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 453360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448720, "text": "You're upset, I can tell. Kwan Lee,\nwe're at the brink of losing our assets."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 457340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 453640, "text": "We're on the end of our rope, and you\nwent out and bought a whole new"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 462880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 457860, "text": "I had to. Oh, yeah, just like you had to\nbuy the Statue of Liberty bedspreads,"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 466340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 462880, "text": "and you had to buy the commemorative\ndinner plates of Princess Di's wedding."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 467579, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 466740, "text": "You too?"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 468439, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467580, "text": "What color?"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 469440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468440, "text": "It's silver."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 473420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 471040, "text": "Mac, those things were just fun."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 481160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478440, "text": "You women always need a new wardrobe."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 482400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481400, "text": "But I do."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 483720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 482720, "text": "Why?"}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 486540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485140, "text": "Because I'm pregnant."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 490180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487440, "text": "What? How could you be pregnant?"}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 514020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513000, "text": "missing since last night."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 518799, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 515100, "text": "Well, he's about six foot two, 200\npounds, muscular build."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 521919, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 519340, "text": "And he may be fondling his sweater."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 524560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523559, "text": "Hello."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 527460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525500, "text": "Hello. Hello, Harry."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 529000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 528000, "text": "Hi, Kwan Lee."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 531160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529240, "text": "Kwan Lee still has nerd from Mac, Your\nHonor."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 532860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531720, "text": "I'm worried, Harry."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 534860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533260, "text": "Maybe he did something drastic."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 536760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 535280, "text": "Kwan Lee, don't even think like that."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 538700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 537260, "text": "Well, he's not in the dumpster."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 545870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 542410, "text": "Bull was just checking out every\npossibility, no matter how remote or"}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 546909, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546170, "text": "Right, Bull?"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 549010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546910, "text": "Yeah, and because you told me to look\nthere."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 552330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 551130, "text": "No Mac in the morgue."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 557530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553730, "text": "Dan? Hi. He sometimes goes down there\nand plays poker with the guys."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 559870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 558150, "text": "Harry, you should see what they use for\nchip."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 565030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 562430, "text": "Juan Lee, I think probably the best\nthing for you to do is just go home and"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 566250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 565030, "text": "wait. We'll call you if we hear\nanything."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 568170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566670, "text": "If you think it's best. I do."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 572870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 568910, "text": "If anything has happened to him, I...\nHoney, nothing has happened to him."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 573870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572870, "text": "me."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 575690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574690, "text": "Thank you, Christine."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 580410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 578990, "text": "He's dead. I know it."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 581870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580870, "text": "Miss Sullivan."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 586050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584330, "text": "Oh, now, what the hell is that?"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 591270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590150, "text": "It's not the generator."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 594110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592790, "text": "All right, what are you doing?"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 596430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594370, "text": "I tracked down a short circuit to your\noffice, sir."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 599870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597610, "text": "Here it is right here. You're not\ngetting any juice to your coffee maker."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 603390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 600110, "text": "Hey, that's great. Listen, Art, we\nreally don't have time for this. No"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 604249, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603490, "text": "your honor."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 605590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604250, "text": "Let's see if we can't get Mr."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 608230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 605830, "text": "Electricity and Mr. Coffee to shake\nhands here."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 610830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 609550, "text": "What are we going to do about Mac?"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 614630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611670, "text": "What do you do? Quit his job so he can\npursue his singing career?"}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 617330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 616330, "text": "Art."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 622830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 619350, "text": "What, since the day we met, have you\nbeen talking about?"}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 626570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624010, "text": "Mac was singing a bunch of songs down at\nthe bar last night."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 627890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626890, "text": "And he's not bad."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 629050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 628050, "text": "What bar?"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 630750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 629450, "text": "Stinky Slaughterhouse Saloon."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 634210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 632870, "text": "Wednesday's Stun Your Own Beef Night."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 637530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 636110, "text": "And you saw Mac in there?"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 641130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637850, "text": "Yeah. He was singing a medley of Slim\nWhitman's greatest hits."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 645090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 642110, "text": "Now listen, when I tell you guys to\nclear, stay away from all electrical"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 646090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645090, "text": "outlets. You got that?"}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 650750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 648990, "text": "We're going to a cowboy bar, aren't we,\nsir?"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 652030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651030, "text": "Yep."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 660800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657360, "text": "Court's ready when you are, Judge. Roz,\ndo me a favor. Call downstairs, tell"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 663920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660800, "text": "them we're going to be starting late\ntonight, and then meet us at Dinky's"}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 665100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663920, "text": "Slaughterhouse Balloon."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 667460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665580, "text": "Dinky? Whatever shall I wear?"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 670220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 669220, "text": "You're done."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 673080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671440, "text": "Okay, get clear of those sockets!"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 676980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 675000, "text": "Now I'm getting way too much curl from\nsomewhere."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 688910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 687370, "text": "Tell me they didn't suffer."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 705750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704150, "text": "This must be the place."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 711010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709990, "text": "What's that smell?"}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 714450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 712530, "text": "I feel like I'm going to throw up."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 716390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 714730, "text": "I think there's a two -bucket minimum."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 735120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733599, "text": "This is my manager."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 736420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 735420, "text": "How you doing?"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 737580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736580, "text": "I'm dusty."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 740180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737780, "text": "I must have the name of your oral\nhygienist."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 744720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742020, "text": "Come on, come on, come on, come on.\nLet's have some beers."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 748460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745200, "text": "Mac, maybe you've had a few too many.\nEverybody get a seat."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 750900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 748760, "text": "Mac, you see, we're not really here. Sit\ndown!"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 757500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755680, "text": "I'll go get us something to gnaw on."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 760680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 758980, "text": "Oh, God, let it be dead."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 766260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764280, "text": "Gotta get him out of here. I don't think\nhe wants to go."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 767840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 766480, "text": "Okay, we gotta get me out of here."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 775400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 773340, "text": "Excuse me, can you tell me where the\nladies' room is, please?"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 778720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775720, "text": "See that group of men kneeling with that\npeephole in the wall?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 781780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780780, "text": "Never mind."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 782900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781900, "text": "I understand."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 785840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 783720, "text": "A little touch of stage fright, huh?"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 793170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 792170, "text": "This is Ginger."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 797150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 794030, "text": "She can spit four ounces of beer through\nher nose."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 801750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 799170, "text": "And no man has snatched you up yet?"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 804390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 803390, "text": "What'll it be?"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 807190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804790, "text": "For starters, you could wipe the blood\noff the table."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 809910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808250, "text": "I'm so hungry I could eat a horse."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 812850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810730, "text": "Cottage fries or the rice pilaf with\nthat?"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 817330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815070, "text": "Um, could I see your wine list, please?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 819630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818630, "text": "Take your pick."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 823220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 822220, "text": "Chardonnay looks good."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 824700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 823700, "text": "I'll get you a can."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 827840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 826720, "text": "She seems nice."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 831200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828320, "text": "Ah, that woman will bend over backwards\nfor you."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 833720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 831500, "text": "She has to to show you the dessert menu."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 838920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837300, "text": "Matt, we've been worried about you."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 840700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 839340, "text": "And you still should be."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 842680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 841240, "text": "Matt, what's that supposed to mean?"}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 848440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 843060, "text": "Well, you know the way my luck's been\ngoing. You hang around me, and I will"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 850720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848440, "text": "something horrible happen to you."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 854920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851600, "text": "What do you mean, like being stuck in a\nstinking fetid room with the folks from"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 855920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854920, "text": "Deliverance?"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 858040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857040, "text": "There you go."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 860280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858700, "text": "Mac, this is not like you."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 862800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 860500, "text": "I mean, so you had a little run of bad\nluck."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 865120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 863760, "text": "A little bad luck?"}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 870100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 865920, "text": "Harry, that's like saying the elephant\nman had a little puffiness around the"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 871100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870100, "text": "eye."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 875900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 874700, "text": "Mac. Yeah?"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 878840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876520, "text": "I don't want to make a big deal out of\nthis, but..."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 884569, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 883690, "text": "on, aren't I?"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 885570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 884570, "text": "Oh,"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 893910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887990, "text": "thank you, thank you, thank you very\nmuch."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 898050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894790, "text": "I'd like to do a tune that's a favorite\nof mine, and I hope it's one of yours,"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 899090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 898090, "text": "too."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 902310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899230, "text": "I call it The Theme from Shaft."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 908930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904350, "text": "You can be the diversion. I'm gonna make\na run for it. How about Psychedelic"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 909930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908930, "text": "Shaft?"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 911750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910750, "text": "Boogaloo down Broadway?"}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 914580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 913580, "text": "Well, what do you suggest?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 916600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915600, "text": "Babaloo!"}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 922780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 920780, "text": "Okay, anything by Desi Arnaz."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 928020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925420, "text": "All right, well, let's give it a shot."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 930200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 929200, "text": "Okay, hit it."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 958480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952079, "text": "Your dreams and your schemes all"}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 960100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958480, "text": "fell through."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 964240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961880, "text": "It's got a good beat. I can dance to it.\nI'll give it a 50, Dick."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1001270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000270, "text": "Am I blue?"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1041490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040490, "text": "What's she doing here?"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1044450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1041730, "text": "Well, I called her to tell her we found\nMac, but I didn't expect her to come"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1045450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1044450, "text": "here."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1049030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1047530, "text": "All of you go home now."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1050730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1049670, "text": "I will handle this."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1053050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050990, "text": "That's good enough for me. Let's do this\nagain real soon. Bye now."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1057050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054850, "text": "Well, help me get him out. I said leave\nhim!"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1062330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059110, "text": "I know you are concerned, and I\nappreciate it."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1066170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1063090, "text": "But I am his wife, and I will take care\nof him."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1071990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070990, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1082770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1077110, "text": "Listen, I hope you'll be here Saturday\nnight, because we got us a wet t -shirt"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1083770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1082770, "text": "contest."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1087910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1085810, "text": "I'd rather dance with a greased pig."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1089230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1088230, "text": "That's Sunday."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1097870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1094830, "text": "Mac, we've been through trouble before."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1100090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098490, "text": "We can get through this one."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1109360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108140, "text": "Let me see you smile."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1114060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113060, "text": "Smile?"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1118180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115160, "text": "I'm laying here licking a stage and you\nwant me to smile?"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1123420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121120, "text": "Mac, we have our whole life ahead of us."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1126780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123900, "text": "We've got nothing but misery ahead of\nus."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1129960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1127620, "text": "Then what are we supposed to do? Come\nin."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1144600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143180, "text": "I think I'm going crazy."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1149460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147920, "text": "You just figured that out?"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1151880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150320, "text": "Thanks, that's reassuring."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1159200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1154980, "text": "When I was a girl in Vietnam, I fell in\nlove with you."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1162380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1159960, "text": "Because you did the craziest thing I\never saw."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1164040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163040, "text": "What was that?"}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1165880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1164580, "text": "You planted corn."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1167120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1166120, "text": "Oh, yeah, yeah."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1169240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1167700, "text": "That was brilliant, wasn't it?"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1172060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170580, "text": "Plowing the jungle floor."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1177220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1173200, "text": "Everybody making fun of me. Max. Monkeys\nlaughing."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1181400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179240, "text": "But you wanted it so bad."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1184540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182640, "text": "Everywhere with death and destruction."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1190580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185380, "text": "But one crazy man tried to make\nsomething grow in the middle of that"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1192040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190580, "text": "hell. But it never did."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1206720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204520, "text": "It was after you shipped back to the\nStates."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1213800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1207080, "text": "We noticed this one little tiny baby\ncorn plant still struggling to grow."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1216260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214580, "text": "It was pretty sick -looking."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1220900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1217440, "text": "But for some reason, it continued to\nlive."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1222860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1221680, "text": "Do you know why?"}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1225120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224120, "text": "Why?"}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1229680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1226560, "text": "It did not know it wasn't supposed to."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1238490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236010, "text": "What kind of father am I going to be?\nWhat kind of provider?"}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1242730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1240530, "text": "We don't even have seeds left."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1246850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244970, "text": "Then we'll get acorns."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1250630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249630, "text": "Acorns?"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1253390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251150, "text": "Remember my poem from English class?"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1258770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1256070, "text": "I am a little acorn."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1262270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1259850, "text": "A fact that's plain to see."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1266440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1263170, "text": "But remember that... The mighty oak."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1274080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271560, "text": "Was once a nut like me."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1281180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279180, "text": "Sometimes you feel like a nut."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1282980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281420, "text": "Sometimes you don't."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1315760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312440, "text": "I thought I'd vaporized a whole bunch of\nyous."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1320260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1316540, "text": "So I take it, Art, all your little\nelectrical problems are taken care of?"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1323620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1320460, "text": "Yep, everything's copacetic, sir. See, I\nhaven't got your coffee maker perking"}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1324940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1323620, "text": "again. So you do."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1326980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325580, "text": "We're almost ready, sir."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1329460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1327220, "text": "Hey, Mac, good to see you."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1331720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1329720, "text": "Or should I say, yippee -ki -yay -oh!"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1333340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1332140, "text": "Please don't, sir."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1336600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1334260, "text": "So how you feeling about that new baby\nnow?"}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1337880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1336880, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1340530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1337930, "text": "Of course, it's caused quite an upheaval\nin our lives."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1344490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340830, "text": "Already? Yeah, well, this morning, Kwan\nLee was upheaving, and after last night,"}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1345510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1344510, "text": "I was upheaving."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1347910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1346690, "text": "Wait till the baby comes."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1351190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1348190, "text": "More heaving? You can kiss that sweater\ngoodbye right now."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1355430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1353310, "text": "Your Honor, the Huebner sisters are\nwaiting to see you."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1357190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1355950, "text": "Herb's kids? What do they want?"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1360250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1357710, "text": "Apparently, they settled their\ndifferences and had some sort of"}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1362190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1360970, "text": "So what about the Ashes?"}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1365470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1362610, "text": "They said whatever you decide to do with\nthem is fine with both of them."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1367070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1365890, "text": "Oh, well, okay."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1374500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1367820, "text": "But I haven't really made a decision\nas... Hey, this thing's empty."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1378560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1375220, "text": "Oh, Peggy, I'm sorry, Rondo. I had to\nuse that herb tea to test the coffee"}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1379560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1378560, "text": "maker."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1389180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1386160, "text": "This wasn't herb tea."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1390600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1389460, "text": "This was herb."}
